//!   registrars (`0x802DCD50/64/68/6C` lock variants and
//!   `0x802DCD9C/B0/B4/B8` unlock variants). They bracket static initialization
//!   and are called with no arguments.
//! * `// unknown:` the meaning of the `0x8035...`/`0x8037...` values returned by
//!   the state-id factories. They are stored in an object field, not called.
//!   The Castle Iggy and Castle Roy tables are now translated at
//!   [`fn_80c04790`] and [`fn_80c15880`]; the constants remain opaque.
