// Wave 5: actor scaffolding, phase handlers, aim solvers and impact effects
// (0x80C00240..0x80C4D1C0)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//
// This section follows call-graph holes left by the earlier passes: the
// controller-array element type used by the Iggy object at `0x80C00240`, the
// three effect spawners that fill the rider/sled slots `+0xE80/+0xE84`, the
// Castle phase handlers in the `0x80C05xxx..0x80C10xxx` range, the two aim
// solvers called by the castle spawn manager, its target-selection helpers, and
