/// Binds the `damage` clip to the model and the damage-animation object and
/// resets the motion fields to enter the hurt state.
///
/// # Original
/// Synthetic base `0x80C00000`; this address is not a runtime address.
/// `FUN_80c4d1c0`, address `0x80C4D1C0`, size 320 bytes,
/// `work/ghidra/rel-d_en_bossNP/export/80c4d1c0_FUN_80c4d1c0.c`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - actor with the name source at `+0x600`, the model at `+0x604`,
///   the main animation at `+0x644`, the damage animation at `+0x6AC` and the
///   class vtable at `+0x60`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Binds the clip named at `0x80C6AB78` twice (main and damage object), sets
/// blend/rate from `0x80C58F78`/`0x80C58F74`, clears `+0x432`, zeros the
/// speeds, stores the side from `0x80096240` at `+0x348`, writes the heading
/// from the `0x8042C1A4` table to `+0x102`, sets `+0x794 = 1`, and calls the
/// `+0x598` slot.
