/// Three-state Koopa knockdown/death phase.
///
/// State 0 runs the model/animation/physics ritual and advances when
/// `0x80064F50` reports state 2 or the actor drops below
/// `0x80C57D64 + y` versus the scene floor; it also clears bit 3 of the flags
/// at `+0x120`. State 1 waits `0x80C61D7C`, plays clip `0x5D3`, emits sound
/// `0x15` and advances. State 2 spawns `Wm_ko_downsmoke` at `0x80C61D80` and
/// advances at `0x80C61D84`.
