/// State entry that starts the `damage` clip and zeros the velocity.
///
/// [`fn_80c4d1c0`] is called first (the export prints it without arguments;
/// the receiver is `actor`). The three current velocity words `+0xE8..+0xF0`
/// are saved to `+0xFA4..+0xFAC`, the vertical speed `+0xB4` and the word
/// `+0xF8` are overwritten, the absolute word `0x8082FFEC` becomes 3 and the
/// actor's slot `+0x18->+0x3D4` becomes 1. The state words `+0xFBC`, `+0xFC0`
/// and the state counter `+0x360` are then set.
