/// `FUN_80c17550`, address `0x80C17550`, size 148 bytes,
/// `work/ghidra/rel-d_en_bossNP/export/80c17550_FUN_80c17550.c`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `actor` - actor entering the state.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Calls [`fn_80c4d1c0`] and writes the velocity copy, `+0xB4`, `+0xF8`,
/// `0x8082FFEC`, the owner flag at `+0x3D4`, `+0xFBC`, `+0xFC0` and `+0x360`.
///
/// # Safety
/// `actor` must be live, and `0x80429D40` must be an initialized owner
/// object.
