/// phase `0x80C60118` (15) the object at `+0x148` is stepped and bit 3 of the
/// flag word at `+0x120` is cleared. At phase `0x80C6011C` (0) the two
/// `+0x6A4` triggers drive the model switch at `+0x67C`; the first also clears
