/// # Original
/// `// synthetic base: 0x80C00000` (analysis address, not a runtime address).
/// `FUN_80c1dbc0`, address `0x80C1DBC0`, size 340 bytes,
/// `work/ghidra/rel-d_en_bossNP/export/80c1dbc0_FUN_80c1dbc0.c`.
