/// Rebuilds the model matrix from the rig at `+0x604` and refreshes the two
/// cached world positions.
///
/// When `+0x7AC` is zero the body only calls `0x8009B5A0`. Otherwise it copies
/// the 12-word matrix from `0x800A42B0` into `+0x7C`, applies the rig heading
