/// Spawns the `0x137`/`0x12A` pair used by the second flying boss.
///
/// # Original
/// `// synthetic base: 0x80C00000` (analysis address, not a runtime address).
/// `FUN_80c32680`, address `0x80C32680`, size 324 bytes,
