/// Resolves a hit between the segment at `+0x128`/`+0x134` and the world.
///
/// # Original
/// `// synthetic base: 0x80C00000` (analysis address, not a runtime address).
/// `FUN_80c543b0`, address `0x80C543B0`, size 244 bytes,
/// `work/ghidra/rel-d_en_bossNP/export/80c543b0_FUN_80c543b0.c`.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `magnitude` - signed impulse magnitude; its absolute value is stored.
/// * `actor` - object with the embedded collider at `+4` and the two segment
///   endpoints `+0x128`/`+0x134`.
/// * `direction` - three-word vector copied to `+0x11C/+0x120/+0x124`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Sets flag bit `8` through `0x80C56240`, calls collider slot `+0x24`,
/// writes the result byte `+0x140`, and on a hit stores the magnitude at
/// `+0x118`, the direction, the relative offset `+0xB8..+0xC0`, and clears
/// `+0x285/+0x286`.
