/// it is `(-x, -y, -300-z)` and `-300` is also written to `+0x15C`. The angle
/// of that vector is stored at `+0x178` with `0x801C14C0`, then
/// `0x80C509B0` and `0x80C56240` are called and the velocity is added to
/// `+0xC/+0x10/+0x14`.
