/// # Original
/// `// synthetic base: 0x80C00000` (analysis address, not a runtime address).
/// `FUN_80c1d550`, address `0x80C1D550`, size 404 bytes,
/// `work/ghidra/rel-d_en_bossNP/export/80c1d550_FUN_80c1d550.c`.
