/// `0x800AB9F0` runs first. The elevation starts at `30.0` (0x80C58B38); when
/// the object stored at `+0x5F8` reports nonzero through vtable slot `+0x14`,
/// the elevation becomes `45.0` (0x80C58B3C). The chosen value is handed to
/// [`fn_80c43b20`] with `this`.
