/// li r6,0; li r4,0; li r7,0; b 0x80064610`. The `main.dol` factory
/// `0x80064610` takes five arguments and forwards the first four to
/// `0x8006CA80`, so this is the usual `(id, resource, out, 0, 0)` spawn shape
/// already used by [`crate::game::bases::fn_806514d0`].
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_80c32660` at `0x80C32660` (28 bytes)
/// - Synthetic base: `0x80C00000`; this is not a runtime address.
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/rel-d_en_bossNP/export/80c32660_FUN_80c32660.c`
