///   `lwz r3,r4+0x18` / `cmpi cr0,0,r3,0` / `beq`, the `+0x60`/`+0x11C`
///   `bcctr`, the reload `lwz r3,r13+0xFFFFA6C0` / `li r4,0` /
///   `bl 0x80066A40`, and `lwz r12,r31+0x544` / `addi r3,r31,1348` /
///   `li r4,1260` / `li r5,0` / `lwz r12,r12+0x24` / `bcctr`).
///
/// # Arguments
/// - `this`: the `dEnBoss_c` actor; `+0x544` is its animation controller.
///
/// # Returns
/// Nothing.
///
/// # Side effects
/// One optional class-slot call on the manager's `+0x18` object, one retirement
/// sweep, and one controller clip switch.
///
/// # Safety
/// `0x80429D40` must hold the live actor manager; the `+0x18` object, when
/// non-null, must have a readable class vtable at `+0x60`; `this + 0x544` must
/// hold a live controller with a callable `+0x24` entry.
///
