/// 0x30-byte transform of the `+0x604` model for attachment key `11`, extracts
/// the three-float translation with
/// [`crate::resource::registry::fn_8016f130`], and subtracts the actor position
/// `+0xAC`/`+0xB0`/`+0xB4`:
