/// are exclusive. The same `+0x394` handler/`+0x14` shape appears in
/// `game::bases::fn_8066bea0`.
///
/// # Original (untabled)
/// - Ghidra: none - no `functions.tsv` row and no export file for `0x8009B8E0`.
/// - Extent: `0x8009B8E0..0x8009B978` (152 bytes); eight zero bytes follow up to
///   `0x8009B980` ([`crate::game::stage::fn_8009b980`]).
/// - Table: slot 254 of the `0x80312750` `dEnBoss_c` vtable (word `0x80312B48`,
///   offset `+0x3F8`).
